            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The first thing you need to know is that ghosts are real.</h2><br>The rest, you can only learn on your own.<br><br>Follow three stories set in a world where the dead linger, and things far worse wait beyond the veil.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Phantom Ice Cream Truck</h2>  <br>Follow a denizen of the border between life and dead as he answers the call to rescue a missing child.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perceptions of the Dead</h2>Tyrone has  made it his business to help solve the troubles of those afflicted by the undead, but what seems like a case of a benign haunting may find him risking more than his life, but his very soul.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live with Jill Count</h2>Jill has had moderate success as a streamer, and to mix things up, this Halloween she is going to life-stream a visit to a haunted hospital. The twist? It's actually haunted.",
